      "text": "The image captures a historic milestone in Philippine retail history: the very first 7-Eleven convenience store in the country.\n\n Located at the bustling corner of EDSA and Kamias Road in Quezon City, the image showcases the distinct retro branding of the store beneath a large billboard for \"Cubad Canvas Upholstery Supply,\" surrounded by classic 1980s vehicular traffic like early model sedans and traditional public jeepneys.\n\n​The arrival of this single store completely transformed the way Filipinos shop, introducing a novel concept that would eventually become a staple of modern everyday life.",
